  "route": "/3308/",
  "title": "HSK\u8BFE\u7A0B\u62DB\u751F\u2014\u2014Mandarin Chinese Beginner for HSK Call For Enrol!",
  "summary": "N\u01D0 h\u01CEo! \u4F60\u597D\uFF01 Welcome to Chinese for HSK Level 1 - a Chinese course for beginners. HSK stands for H\u00E0ny\u01D4 (Chinese) Shu\u01D0p\u00EDng (level) K\u01CEosh\u00EC (test), which is the most important Chinese proficiency test in use today. It assesses non-native Chi\u2026",
  "body": "\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/frc-550679dfe85ea5a96e71fefbaf8deb81.png\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EN\u01D0 h\u01CEo! \u4F60\u597D\uFF01Welcome to Chinese for HSK Level 1 - a Chinese course for beginners.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHSK stands for H\u0026#224;ny\u01D4 (Chinese) Shu\u01D0p\u0026#237;ng (level) K\u01CEosh\u0026#236; (test), which is the most important Chinese proficiency test in use today. It assesses non-native Chinese speakers\u2019 abilities in using Chinese in their daily, academic and professional lives.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the end of the course, you will be able to understand and use simple Chinese phrases, meet basic needs for communication and possess the ability to further your Chinese language studies.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe class will start on 2nd Aug 2022. For registration, please visit: \u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003Ehttp://sg.mikecrm.com/qwHXDs9\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAny enquiries, please contact:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMs Linn at 603 - 2181 3428.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHave a fantastic journey of Chinese learning.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor more information about China Cultural Centre in Kuala Lumpur, please visit:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003Ewww.chinaculturalcentre.my\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E- End -\n\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u957F\u6309\u8BC6\u522B\u4E8C\u7EF4\u7801\n\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u83B7\u53D6\u66F4\u591A\u7CBE\u5F69\u5185\u5BB9\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u25BC\u003C/strong\u003E\n\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/frc-393d7a99f3f2b62d8101a4e46568d89f.png\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/frc-55a705354cac3bb838e283010202f339.png\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/frc-e592b6d7fcb0f17eb92480e99a800f61.png\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/frc-38bc8c97af1c04b93222b36dcb5bbbce.png\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/frc-66f61deeda48ac066eaadc74e0ff7ca3.gif\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u5206\u4EAB\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/frc-4db2f23cf0e6f951e341ba1ced8f0917.gif\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u6536\u85CF\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/frc-280a49ece728eeef36bddfc55343e370.gif\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHSK \u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/frc-2bef5eb45056a72b7565d3b6c80d4a2f.gif\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u8BFE\u7A0B\n\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/frc-8d50aaa027045ecf6acc610884c4aaf0.gif\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u6765\u6E90\uFF1A\u003Ca href=\u0022https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/OO0KRSGzRQRvBhLbzM_r0Q\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener noreferrer\u0022\u003E\u9605\u8BFB\u539F\u6587\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n",
